OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787059118
OL,3,CPolice forces to use AI on 101 service
OL,4,Cto screen 'ridiculous calls'
OL,6,FPolice forces will implement a new
OL,7,Fsystem using artificial intelligence
OL,8,Fsoftware for non-emergency calls on
OL,9,Fits 101 service.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Police started to use
OL,12,Fthe new software from 10am on Tuesday
OL,13,F18 August.
OL,15,FThe force says the 'Natural Language
OL,16,FProcessing software' will help them to
OL,17,Fcut waiting times and allow them to
OL,18,Fstop wasting time on what it calls
OL,19,F'ridiculous calls'.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
