FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787059118
OL,3,CPolice forces to use AI on 101 service
OL,4,Cto screen 'ridiculous calls'
OL,6,FIn a statement on its website, South
OL,7,FYorkshire Police said: "Nationally,
OL,8,Fthe police's non-emergency line
OL,9,Freceives 20 million calls each year.
OL,10,FAround 20% ` four million ` of these
OL,11,Fare for non-policing organisations
OL,12,Fsuch as local councils, NHS 111 or the
OL,13,F105 power outage helpline.
OL,15,F"However, the line also receives
OL,16,Fridiculous calls reporting issues such
OL,17,Fas delayed pizza deliveries, slow pub
OL,18,Fservice and requests for a lift,
OL,19,Fwasting vital time that police should
OL,20,Fbe spending tackling crime."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787059118
OL,3,CPolice forces to use AI on 101 service
OL,4,Cto screen 'ridiculous calls'
OL,6,FThe Home Office gave other examples of
OL,7,Fnuisance calls that it is hoping to
OL,8,Fcut out. In one instance on 28 July, a
OL,9,Fcaller asked Humberside Police to pick
OL,10,Fthem up because they needed a lift.
OL,12,FIn another on 27 July, someone called
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police to report a
OL,14,Flost umbrella.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787059118
OL,3,CPolice forces to use AI on 101 service
OL,4,Cto screen 'ridiculous calls'
OL,6,FDeveloped by the Home Office, National
OL,7,FPolice Chiefs' Council and Vodafone,
OL,8,Fthe AI model will 'match why someone
OL,9,Fis calling 101 to a set of likely
OL,10,Freasons' and aims to redirect issues
OL,11,Fnot deemed to relate to the police to
OL,12,Fthe suitable agency.
OL,14,FSouth Yorkshire Police say the
OL,15,Fsoftware has been through rigorous
OL,16,FHome Office testing to allay worries
OL,17,Fthat callers' accents or phrasing may
OL,18,Finadvertently mean that their calls
OL,19,Fare misdirected.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787059118
OL,3,CPolice forces to use AI on 101 service
OL,4,Cto screen 'ridiculous calls'
OL,6,FCrime and Policing Minister, Sarah
OL,7,FJones, said: "Police call handlers are
OL,8,Fwasting hours fielding calls meant for
OL,9,Fother organisations. Every minute
OL,10,Fspent on these calls is time taken
OL,11,Faway from helping people who genuinely
OL,12,Fneed their support.
OL,14,F"AI is already helping police catch
OL,15,Fdangerous criminals and speed up
OL,16,Finvestigations. Now, it will help
OL,17,Fbring control rooms into the 21st
OL,18,Fcentury, freeing up time and unlocking
OL,19,Fmillions of pounds."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1787059118
OL,3,CPolice forces to use AI on 101 service
OL,4,Cto screen 'ridiculous calls'
OL,6,FThe Home Office say it estimates that
OL,7,Fthe new system will "save policing up
OL,8,Fto #8.5 million each year, releasing
OL,9,Ffunds for local forces to invest in
OL,10,Ftheir most pressing priorities".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/6
